					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-470437#post-1461179</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-470437/brother-s-keeper#post-1461179</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 26 May 2012 21:37:02 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>zaratustra</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>383598</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Haha, part was just me being tired of everyone saying 073 and 076 are awful and make no sense, and part wondering just how the Foundation has so many Book of Genesis expies as SCPs, all of them equally circumspect about where exactly they came from. (More factoids: Four of the precursor's names stand for SCPs and one is -rumored- to be in the Foundation, leaving Orion/Niyphelah and Cela/Eve.)</p> <p>Everyone's favorite line comes from a friend on another IRC channel, who argued that the Gideons were vampire hunters building a ward on every hotel room to hinder foreign vampires. From there to &quot;Bible as containment manual&quot; is a small jump if you think that way.</p> <p>And hey, I didn't actually intend that anyone <em>believe</em> this stuff.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
